2 board and the later 3x3 board independently from SpriteKit drawing code.","type":"text"}]},"08-RotationModeGuard.swift":{"content":["func setRotationModeEnabled(_ enabled: Bool) {","    if isRotationModeEnabled == enabled {","        return","    }","","    isRotationModeEnabled = enabled","","    let targetScale: CGFloat = enabled ? 0.82 : 1.0","    let scaleAction = SCNAction.scale(to: targetScale, duration: 0.18)","","    cubeNode.removeAction(forKey: \"rotationModeScale\")","    cubeNode.runAction(scaleAction, forKey: \"rotationModeScale\")","","    if enabled {","        debugText = \"회전 모드 ON: 드래그로 큐브를 돌려 다음 stage 면을 확인하세요.\"","    } else {","        debugText = \"회전 모드 OFF: 현재 stage 면을 터치해 경로를 이어갑니다.\"","    }","}","","private var rotationModeBinding: Binding<Bool> {","    Binding {","        viewModel.isRotationModeEnabled","    } set: { newValue in","        viewModel.setRotationModeEnabled(newValue)","    }","}","","Toggle(isOn: rotationModeBinding) {","    Label(\"회전 모드\", systemImage: \"rotate.left.and.right\")","}",".toggleStyle(.switch)"],"fileType":"swift","highlights":[],"identifier":"08-RotationModeGuard.swift","type":"file","fileName":"SceneKitPuzzleViewModel.swift and ContentView.swift","syntax":"swift"},"doc://com.example.CubeOneStrokePuzzle/tutorials/Cube-One-Stroke-Puzzle/07-SceneKit-Cube-Material-And-Texture-Touch#Create-the-cube-material":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.example.CubeOneStrokePuzzle\/tutorials\/Cube-One-Stroke-Puzzle\/07-SceneKit-Cube-Material-And-Texture-Touch#Create-the-cube-material","abstract":[{"text":"Put SpriteKit puzzle scenes on multiple faces of an ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SCNBox"},{"type":"text","text":", then convert a 3D surface tap into the current stage’s 2D tile coordinate."}],"url":"\/tutorials\/cube-one-stroke-puzzle\/07-scenekit-cube-material-and-texture-touch#Create-the-cube-material","role":"pseudoSymbol","kind":"section","type":"section","title":"Create the cube material"},"doc://com.examp